READING RULE FOR THE THESIS
  Model A (panel only) may no longer be reported on its own. Every panel AUC
  must be accompanied by model B, the composition-only benchmark, and by the
  LRT of C against B. A panel that does not beat B is a white-cell count.
  Every Male row is EXPLORATORY: n = 38/13/9 cannot support a diagnostic claim.

